---
// Bento Grid de Escala & Métricas Verificadas para Las Arenas del Santa
---

<section id="escala" class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-slate-900 border-y border-slate-800 relative z-20 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
